  "text": "INNO3D GEFORCE GTX 1660 TI TWIN X2 | Inno3D - Graphics Cards\nSkip to main content\nImage\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\nBreadcrumb\nHome\nProduct\nN166T2-06D6-1710VA15\nThe new Supercharger\nINNO3D GEFORCE GTX 1660 TI TWIN X2\nINNO3D GEFORCE GTX 1660 TI TWIN X2\nKEY FEATURES\nSPECIFICATION\nPRODUCT IMAGES\nPOWER UP YOUR GAME\nwith the new Supercharger\nINNO3D introduces its new Supercharger INNO3D® GeForce® GTX 1660 Ti Twin X2. The award-winning NVIDIA Turing™ architecture adds the INNO3D® GeForce® GTX 1660 Ti Twin X2 to its product line with advanced graphics performance that contends with the INNO3D® GeForce® GTX 1070. The superfast speeds from the supercharged Turing engine will tackle modern titles with ease.\nTURING SHADERS\nFeaturing concurrent execution of floating point and integer operations, adaptive shading technology, and a new unified memory architecture with twice the cache of its predecessor, Turing shaders enable awesome performance increases on today’s games. Get even bigger performance boosts in modern games that take advantage of Turing’s advanced graphics features.\nAWESOME\nPERFORMANCE\nGet game ready with performance that rivals the GeForce GTX 1070 on the latest games with the GeForce GTX 1660 T.\nAMAZING GAMING PERFORMANCE WITH \u0003EFFICIENT COOLING SOLUTIONS\nINNO3D GeForce GTX 1660 Ti Twin X2 boasts 6GB of memory, GDDR6 with 192-bit running at 12Gbps and it is equipped with the same powerful cooling solution from the RTX™ 2060 and RTX™ 2070. The sheer performance of the GTX 1660 Ti Twin X2 gives amazing performance and image quality while livestreaming to Twitch or YouTube. The GTX 1660 Ti’s dedicated hardware encoder delivers 15% improved efficiency over prior-generation graphics cards and is optimised for Open Broadcaster Software (OBS).\nSTRONG PROTECTION BY\nINNO3D REINFORCING BACKPLATE\nINNO3D produces the new backplate which provide the strong protection to full-length PCB and protects the GPU card from any external harm!\nINNO3D GRAPHICS ENGINE\nYou could control the clock speeds, voltage, fan performance, lighting effect by INNO3D engine software. Simply tuning the card to achieve your requirement and support the power for the ultimate gaming.\nFEATURES AND BENEFITS\nGeForce Experience\nCapture and share videos, screenshots, and livestreams with friends. Keep your GeForce drivers up to date. And optimize your game settings. GeForce Experience™ lets you do it all. It’s the essential companion to your GeForce graphics card.\nNVIDIA Ansel\nThis powerful photo mode lets you take professional-grade photographs of your games like never before. Now, you can capture and share your most brilliant gaming experiences with super-resolution, 360-degree, HDR, and stereo photographs.\nBroadcast Like a Pro\nGet amazing performance and image quality while livestreaming to Twitch or YouTube. GTX 1660 Ti’s dedicated hardware encoder delivers 15% improved efficiency over prior generation graphics cards and is optimized for Open Broadcaster Software (OBS).\nPrivacy Policy | Contact Us\n© 2019 NVIDIA Corporation. NVIDIA, the NVIDIA logo, GeForce, GeForce Experience, GeForce RTX, G-SYNC, NVLink, and ShadowPlay are registered trademarks and/or trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation in the United States and other countries. All other trademarks and copyrights are the property of their respective owners.\n© 2019 INNOVISION Multimedia Limited. All rights reserved. The INNO3D, INNO3D and iCHILL logo are the registered trademarks of INNOVISION Multimedia Ltd. in Asia, Europe and / or other countries. All other company and / or product names may be trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners.\nThe terms HDMI and HDMI High-Definition Multimedia Interface, and the HDMI Logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of HDMI Licensing Administrator, Inc.\nDatasheet:\nGPU Engine Specs\nGPU Engine Specs\nCUDA Cores\n1536\nBoost Clock (MHz)\n1770 MHz\nBase Clock (MHz)\n1500 MHz\nThermal and Power Spec\nThermal and Power Spec\nMinimum System Power Requirement (W)\n450W\nSupplementary Power Connectors\n8-pin\nMemory Specs\nMemory Specs\nMemory Clock\n12Gbps\nStandard Memory Config\n6GB\nMemory Interface\nGDDR6\nMemory Interface Width\n192-bit\nMemory Bandwidth (GB/sec)\n288 GB/sec\nFeature Support\nFeature Support\nNVIDIA Architecture\nTuring\nMicrosoft DirectX\n12 Ultimate\nNVIDIA GeForce Experience\nYes\nNVIDIA Ansel\nYes\nNVIDIA FreeStyle\nYes\nBus Support\nPCI-E 3.0 X16\nNVIDIA ShadowPlay\nYes\nOS Certification\nWindows 10, Linux, FreeBSDx86\nNVIDIA Highlights\nYes\nNVIDIA G-SYNC™-Ready\nYes\nGame Ready Drivers\nYes\nNVIDIA Studio Drivers\nYes\nNVIDIA GPU Boost™\nYes\nVulkan API\nYes\nOpenGL\n4.5\nNVIDIA Encoder\n6th Generation\nNVIDIA Decoder\n4th Generation\nAccessories\nAccessories\nInstallation Guide\nYes\nPower Guide\nYes\nGraphics Card Dimensions:\nGraphics Card Dimensions\nLength\n196mm\nHeight\n113mm\nWidth\n2-slot\nDisplay Support\nDisplay Support\nMulti Monitor\nYes\nMaxmium Digital Resolution\n7680x4320\nHDCP\n2.2\nStandard Display Connectors\nHDMI 2.0b, DisplayPort 1.4 x3\nTOP\nNEWSLETTER\nGet the latest news and more.\nLeave this field blank\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GU